<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      border: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #636b2f 0%, #4f5625 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 32px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 6px 0 0 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 32px 30px;
    }
    .lead-card {
      background: #f9fff3;
      border: 1px solid #bac095;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .lead-card-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #636b2f;
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    }
    .lead-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .lead-row:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .lead-label {
      color: #666666;
      min-width: 80px;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding-top: 1px;
    }
    .lead-value {
      color: #1a1a1a;
      font-weight: 600;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
    .lead-value a {
      color: #636b2f;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .stats-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .stat-box {
      flex: 1;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .stat-number {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #636b2f;
      display: block;
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #888888;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 28px 0 8px 0;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      background-color: #636b2f;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99,107,47,0.3);
    }
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      color: #888888;
      font-size: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #636b2f;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f5f5f5;">

  <div class="container" style="background-color:#ffffff;">

    <div class="header" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#636b2f 0%,#4f5625 100%); color:#ffffff; padding:32px 30px; text-align:center;">
      <div class="header-badge" style="display:inline-block; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); color:#ffffff; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:20px; margin-bottom:12px;">
        🎯 New Lead
      </div>
      <h1 style="margin:0; font-size:26px; font-weight:800;">Someone just reached out!</h1>
      <p style="margin:6px 0 0 0; font-size:14px; opacity:0.85;">Your AI captured a new lead on <strong>{{businessName}}</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="content" style="padding:32px 30px;">

      <p style="font-size:16px; margin:0 0 20px 0; color:#1a1a1a;">
        Great news — a visitor chatted with your AI and left their contact details. Here's what was captured:
      </p>

      <div class="lead-card" style="background:#f9fff3; border:1px solid #bac095; border-radius:10px; padding:24px; margin:24px 0;">
        <p class="lead-card-title" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#636b2f; margin:0 0 16px 0;">Contact Details</p>

        <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
          <tr style="margin-bottom:12px;">
            <td style="color:#666; font-size:13px; width:80px; vertical-align:top; padding:4px 0;">Name</td>
            <td style="color:#1a1a1a; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; padding:4px 0;">{{leadName}}</td>
          </tr>
          {{#if leadEmail}}
          <tr>
            <td style="color:#666; font-size:13px; width:80px; vertical-align:top; padding:4px 0;">Email</td>
            <td style="color:#1a1a1a; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; padding:4px 0;">
              <a href="mailto:{{leadEmail}}" style="color:#636b2f; text-decoration:none;">{{leadEmail}}</a>
            </td>
          </tr>
          {{/if}}
          {{#if leadPhone}}
          <tr>
            <td style="color:#666; font-size:13px; width:80px; vertical-align:top; padding:4px 0;">Phone</td>
            <td style="color:#1a1a1a; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; padding:4px 0;">{{leadPhone}}</td>
          </tr>
          {{/if}}
          <tr>
            <td style="color:#666; font-size:13px; width:80px; vertical-align:top; padding:4px 0;">Captured</td>
            <td style="color:#1a1a1a; font-size:14px; padding:4px 0;">{{capturedAt}}</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>

      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:24px 0;">
        <tr>
          <td style="width:50%; padding-right:6px;">
            <div style="background:#f5f5f5; border-radius:8px; padding:14px; text-align:center;">
              <span style="font-size:24px; font-weight:800; color:#636b2f; display:block;">{{messageCount}}</span>
              <span style="font-size:11px; color:#888; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Messages exchanged</span>
            </div>
          </td>
          <td style="width:50%; padding-left:6px;">
            <div style="background:#f5f5f5; border-radius:8px; padding:14px; text-align:center;">
              <span style="font-size:24px; font-weight:800; color:#636b2f; display:block;">1</span>
              <span style="font-size:11px; color:#888; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">New lead today</span>
            </div>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <div style="text-align:center; margin:28px 0 8px 0;">
        <a href="https://formachat.com/#/dashboard" class="btn-primary"
           style="display:inline-block; padding:14px 32px; background-color:#636b2f; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:700; font-size:15px; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(99,107,47,0.3);">
          View Lead in Dashboard →
        </a>
      </div>

      <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #eeeeee; margin:28px 0;">

      <p style="font-size:13px; color:#888; margin:0; text-align:center;">
        This lead was automatically captured by your FormaChat AI agent.<br>
        Reply promptly — leads convert best within the first hour.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="footer" style="text-align:center; padding:20px 30px; background-color:#f9fafb; color:#888; font-size:12px; border-top:1px solid #eee;">
      <p style="margin:4px 0;">&copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin:4px 0;">Questions? <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com" style="color:#636b2f; text-decoration:none;">support@formachat.com</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
